abbas ke laashe pe baya'n karte the sarwar<br>
shabbir ka ab koi nahi monis o yawar<br>
<br>
poochhe jo sakina mere ammu ko huwa kya <br>
kaise kahu'n ke so gaye baazu ko kata kar<br>
<br>
kya qalb pe zainab ke guzar jayegi bhayya <br>
jab khoon me tar mashk o alam dekhegi khwahar<br>
<br>
akber hai na qasim hai na ab aun o mohd <br>
shabbir pe jaa'n apni fida kar gaye asgher<br>
<br>
maotal me jo tanha mujhe dekhegi wo dukhiya <br>
abbas tumhe degi sada zainb e muztar<br>
<br>
ab khole huwe baal nazar aayegi amma <br>
naize pe nazar aayega bhai ka mere sar<br>
<br>
zehra ki duwa parcham e saqqa-e-haram hai <br>
matam isi parcham tale ab hoga baradar<br>
<br>
sahil pe tadap jayega abbas ka laasha <br>
zainab jo kahegi mere bhayya meri chadar<br>
